NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/553430",
            "title": "pipewire: make package more configurable",
            "date_modified": "2026-08-23T13:58:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-08-16T20:37:16.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "aanderse",
                "url": "https://github.com/aanderse"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29818440?u=3d5719046fc2b935d980258fed433232b61cb7ed&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Previously after changing some pipewire configuration and switching to the new system config, the new pipewire config didn't get loaded and the user had to manually restart the service (after figuring out that their config was not applied by the module automatically).</p>\n<details>\n  <summary>Reproduce the problem</summary>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>query some pipewire config, e.g. <code class=\"notranslate\">pw-cli info 0 | grep default.clock.rate</code> -&gt; 48000</li>\n<li>override the previous config with this module and switch-to-configuration:</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-nix notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  services.pipewire.extraConfig.pipewire.&quot;10-clock-rate&quot; = {\n    &quot;context.properties&quot; = {\n      &quot;default.clock.rate&quot; = 44100;\n    };\n  };\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-c1\"><span class=\"pl-s1\">services</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">pipewire</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">extraConfig</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-s1\">pipewire</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">.</span><span class=\"pl-s\">\"10-clock-rate\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-s\">\"context.properties\"</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"pl-s\">\"default.clock.rate\"</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">44100</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></pre></div>\n<ol start=\"3\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>observe that the same query still returns the old value: <code class=\"notranslate\">pw-cli info 0 | grep default.clock.rate</code> -&gt; 48000</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">systemctl --user restart pipewire.service</code></li>\n<li>now it gives the new value: <code class=\"notranslate\">pw-cli info 0 | grep default.clock.rate</code> -&gt; 44100</li>\n</ol>\n</details>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've seen socket activation + proper config reload needing <code class=\"notranslate\">stopIfChanged = false</code>, but I'm not exactly sure why yet. Sometimes the new config applies without it, sometimes it doesn't.<br>\nThe core behaviour matches the <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/#sec-unit-handling\" rel=\"nofollow\">docs</a>, where with <code class=\"notranslate\">stopIfChanged = false</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">switch-to-configuration</code> says that the <code class=\"notranslate\">pipewire.service</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">pipewire.socket</code> is being restarted, with <code class=\"notranslate\">stopIfChanged = true</code> it says that these 2 are being stopped and <code class=\"notranslate\">pipewire.socket</code> is being started, except the service logs don't mention any events for the latter.<br>\nRelated issue which I only glanced at before sleep: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"531839114\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/74899\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/74899/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/74899\">#74899</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I can imagine that config (and package?) changes were intentionally not restarting the services to avoid breaking apps (e.g. by manually restarting pipewire and pipewire-pulse while a video was playing in a browser, I had to reload the page to get audio working again), I wonder if we'd get mass reports that music/videos stopped playing after a system update's switch-to-configuration, and in worse cases a full app restart is needed.<br>\nIf this was the intention, I recommend we document it instead in the options' descriptions, and put the reload functionality behind a new option.</p>\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tested basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li>Nixpkgs Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NixOS Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
